
@url = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = PEGAR_TOKEN_AQUI

### Listar conductores
GET {{url}}/conductores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear conductor
POST {{url}}/conductores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Juan",
  "apellido": "Pérez",
  "numero_documento": "30111222",
  "numero_licencia": "LIC12345",
  "fecha_alta_licencia": "2020-01-10",
  "fecha_vencimiento_licencia": "2030-01-10"
}

### Modificar conductor
PUT {{url}}/conductores/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Juan",
  "apellido": "Pérez",
  "numero_documento": "30111222",
  "numero_licencia": "LIC12345",
  "fecha_alta_licencia": "2020-01-10",
  "fecha_vencimiento_licencia": "2030-01-10"
}

### Eliminar conductor
DELETE {{url}}/conductores/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
